# FizzBuzz de 1 a 15
HESOYAM i = 1 ×
BAGUVIX L1 i <= 15 R1 △
    AEZAKMI L1 i % 15 == 0 R1 △
        CJPHONEHOME "FizzBuzz" ×
    ○ ASNAEB AEZAKMI L1 i % 3 == 0 R1 △
        CJPHONEHOME "Fizz" ×
    ○ ASNAEB AEZAKMI L1 i % 5 == 0 R1 △
        CJPHONEHOME "Buzz" ×
    ○ ASNAEB △
        CJPHONEHOME i ×
    ○
    i = i + 1 ×
○
